    "text": "KXII.com\nwebsite\nArdmore\nArdmore parks see increase in vandalism\nBy Maresa Sisk,\n1 hours agoARDMORE, Okla. (KXII) - In the last month, there’s been an increase in graffiti throughout Ardmore’s parks. “It’s really strange because we go years without any and have,” Armoire Parks and Recreation Director Teresa Ervin said. “I can count on one hand how many times we’ve really had to deal with it.”",
